{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "0a926400-2125-89a5-b930-20b9d06666fd",
  "created_at": "2026-01-27T13:59:54-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, City Clerk",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Gerard Hanlon",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Rosa Delgado",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T13:55:21-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "City Clerk's office, this is Rosa. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T13:55:26-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi, yes, hello, good afternoon. Sure, thanks for taking my call. I'm, um, I'm trying to find out about a license for a food truck. Down at the waterfront."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T13:55:36-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. A food truck license. Are you looking to park and sell right on the waterfront, like on city property, or on a private lot?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T13:55:45-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure, of course, yeah. The waterfront. I mean, absolutely, I think that's city property? Is it? I'm not totally sure which one it is."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T13:55:54-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That matters, actually. Which spot are you thinking of? Near the wharf, or one of the lots?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T13:56:00-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Um, so, near where the boats are, by the, the main stretch where people walk. Sure. Is that the city's or somebody else's?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T13:56:08-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "A lot of that area is mixed. Some is city, some is private. You'd have to confirm the exact spot. But either way, a mobile food vendor generally needs a license through our office, and there can be health approval from the state side too."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T13:56:23-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, absolutely. The state too. So that's two different, um, two different places I go? Or is it one form?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T13:56:30-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Two different things. The city license is one. The health and food safety piece is separate. You'd do both."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T13:56:37-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Right, right, of course. So the city one is the license, and the health one is the, the permit? Or is the permit the city one?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T13:56:46-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "The city one is the license from us. The health one is more of an approval or a certification. Different office, different paperwork."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T13:56:54-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, sure. Got it. Sorry, one sec, my phone's on speaker, can you hear me okay?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T13:57:00-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "A little echoey, but I can hear you fine."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T13:57:04-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Great, great. So, um, what's the fee? For the license. Like roughly."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T13:57:09-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I don't have the fee in front of me, and it can depend on the type of license and how long it runs. I can have someone confirm it or you can pick up the application and it'll be listed."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T13:57:22-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure, absolutely. Is there a, like, a seasonal one versus a year one? Because I only want, I mean, I don't know, summer maybe? Or is it a, a yearly thing only?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T13:57:33-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I'd have to check on that. Some licenses are annual and run on a calendar year. I don't want to tell you wrong about a seasonal option."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T13:57:42-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, of course. Yeah. So if it's annual and I start in, say, May, I'd still, um, pay for the whole year? Or is it by month?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T13:57:51-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I can't say for sure. That's one of the questions I'd put on a note for the licensing person. Can I take your name and a number?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T13:58:00-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Absolutely. Gerard Hanlon. H-A-N-L-O-N. And the number is 401-555-0181."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T13:58:04-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Gerard Hanlon, 401-555-0181. Got it. And are you a Newport resident, or from outside the city?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T13:58:10-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Um, I rent here in Newport now. But I was born across the bay, in Bristol. Does that matter? For the license?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T13:58:18-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, no, not for that. I just ask so I know who I'm talking to. Living in Newport might matter for some things, but I'll note you're a renter here."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T13:58:28-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure, of course. Okay. And should I be bringing anything, like, a copy of the truck registration? Or insurance? Or do I not even have the truck yet, is that a problem?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T13:58:39-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It's usually easier with the truck details, since they'll ask about the vehicle and insurance. If you don't have it yet, ask them if you can start the paperwork anyway. I'll write that down too."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T13:58:51-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Absolutely. Okay. So wait, I just want to make sure I have it. I call the health people, separate, and you folks call me about the fee and the, um, the seasonal thing?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T13:59:02-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Right. Somebody from our office will call you back about the fee and whether there's a shorter option. And the health approval you'd contact separately. They're the state side."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T13:59:12-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure. And the, uh, the waterfront spot, that's, who do I ask about that? Is that you or somebody else?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T13:59:19-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That could be a different office too, depending on who owns the spot. I'll flag it in the note so they can point you the right way."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T13:59:28-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, of course. Sorry, it's a lot of, there's a lot of pieces. I think I've got it. Mostly. The license is you, the health is the state, and the spot is, um, maybe somebody else."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T13:59:40-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's it. You've got it. Expect a call back in a day or two."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T13:59:45-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Absolutely. Great. Thank you so much, really, thanks Rosa."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T13:59:49-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You're welcome, Gerard. Have a good afternoon."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T13:59:52-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You too, sure. Bye."
    }
  ],
